.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Enhance customer experience</strong> \u2013 Study customer behavior, optimize their shopping journey, and ensure their satisfaction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Expand your empire</strong> \u2013 Start with a small grocery store and transform it into a thriving supermarket chain while overcoming market challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498270/extras/Nouveau_GIF_Page_Steam.gif?t=1747574616\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Are You Ready for the Challenge?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you dream of building a retail empire and tackling the challenges of real entrepreneurship, <strong>Better Mart</strong> is the game for you. Manage your inventory, oversee your staff, optimize customer experience, and turn your store into a true success story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Take charge and build the ultimate supermarket today!</strong> \ud83d\ude80</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498270/extras/Nouveau_GIF_Page_Steam_2.gif?t=1747574616\" /></p>","developers":["Exanticx Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498270/042dbc397d6c220f81f2b2aea25f9e8544853ccf/header.jpg?t=1747574616","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":25714045